# Line endings, pinned, because a test in this repository rejects a carriage return.
#
# tests/repo/hygiene.test.mjs fails on any byte below 0x20 that is not a newline or a tab,
# and CR is one of them. Git for Windows converts on checkout by default, so without this
# file the same commit is clean on ubuntu and full of control bytes on windows-latest --
# a red build caused by the checkout rather than by the code.
#
# `eol=lf` is the working tree as well as the archive: this project's build claims
# byte-identical output, and a hash that depends on which platform checked the tree out
# would make that claim untestable in CI.

* text=auto eol=lf
